{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.082135522290642721,"t":"Test 1","y":0.046511628184563891,"w":0.061601645151774076,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1,"w":0.13552361806233726,"t":"READING","x":0.43326488491133652,"y":0.091569767546728409},{"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","y":0.15398230080150399,"w":0.30800821940104167,"h":0.014749262536873253,"c":1,"x":0.082135520587651931},{"y":0.1902654868540562,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","h":0.019174041297935096,"x":0.084188918439843025,"c":1,"w":0.81519505818684901},{"x":0.082135522549873871,"w":0.17043121337890621,"t":"Passage 1 below.","y":0.20930232568722551,"h":0.016066406047449688,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.023360430737160653,"t":"How tennis rackets have changed","x":0.25256674451437239,"y":0.25280236029584935,"w":0.49897328694661464},{"c":1,"x":0.082079655189128672,"w":0.81120351155598958,"y":0.29310537987750673,"t":"In 2016, the British professional tennis player Andy Murray was ranked as the world's number","h":0.019172081061169188},{"y":0.31238938064649613,"t":"one. It was an incredible achievement by any standard - made even more remarkable by the","w":0.78644765218098944,"x":0.082135516726673075,"h":0.016224188790560312,"c":1},{"w":0.80492813110351558,"y":0.32848837194477398,"h":0.017529327257544525,"x":0.082135530012923827,"c":1,"t":"fact that he did this during a period considered to be one of the strongest in the sport's history,"},{"y":0.3473837209479349,"t":"competing against the likes of Rafael Nadal, Roger Federer and Novak Djokovic, to name just a","x":0.080082142566772249,"w":0.82340861002604171,"h":0.017513034336686495,"c":1},{"y":0.36466499822935905,"t":"tew. Yet five years previously, he had been regarded as a talented outsider who entered but never","x":0.080042426600829136,"w":0.82760864257812505,"h":0.018381335953343902,"c":1},{"w":0.24465601603190104,"x":0.081989176920725576,"t":"won the major tournaments.","c":1,"h":0.015468964815843034,"y":0.38430510506672855},{"h":0.016008952092983697,"c":1,"y":0.4185840710429366,"w":0.7987679545084635,"x":0.082135529830504761,"t":"Of the changes that account for this transformation, one was visible and widely publicised: in"},{"c":1,"y":0.43451327391712913,"h":0.0189750975212164,"t":"2011, Murray invited former number one player Ivan Lendl onto his coaching team - a valuable","x":0.082135519433142665,"w":0.82135523478190109},{"w":0.79876795450846361,"x":0.080082141919279481,"h":0.017537901886796603,"t":"addition that had a visible impact on the player's playing style. Another change was so subtle","y":0.45339233042715044,"c":1},{"h":0.016224188790560534,"t":"as to pass more or less unnoticed. Like many players, Murray has long preferred a racket","x":0.080082134318764514,"c":1,"y":0.47227138664981405,"w":0.76386037190755207},{"t":"that consists of two types of string: one for the mains (verticals) and another for the crosses","y":0.489825581509861,"h":0.016074123776416149,"x":0.080082141192780412,"w":0.78234085083007809,"c":1},{"w":0.76591374715169269,"c":1,"t":"(horizontals). While he continued to use natural string in the crosses, in 2012 he switched","x":0.080082144966248076,"y":0.50581395379663507,"h":0.01896480684083468},{"c":1,"w":0.76796712239583342,"t":"to a synthetic string for the mains. A small change, perhaps, but its importance should not","x":0.080082147136842627,"y":0.52616279081266049,"h":0.016020100236290635},{"c":1,"x":0.081919408261582727,"y":0.54306949868750742,"t":"be underestimated.","w":0.16473882039388021,"h":0.015146523309668258},{"c":1,"w":0.77002054850260415,"y":0.57846607695414709,"h":0.017464155574112183,"t":"The modification that Murray made is just one of a number of options available to players","x":0.082135516175977447},{"w":0.82768412272135417,"y":0.59441032443786701,"h":0.02071467261750437,"t":"looking to tweak their rackets in order to improve their games.ạiTouring professionals have their","c":1,"x":0.079998606743913764},{"h":0.017539616812646819,"y":0.61327433647513729,"x":0.080082141399388712,"t":"rackets customised to their specific needs,' says Colin Triplow, a UK-based professional racket","w":0.81519505818684879,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"stringer: 'It's a highly important part of performance maximisation.' Consequently, the specific","w":0.81108825683593755,"x":0.080082157738773099,"y":0.63067846635005598,"h":0.017699115044247704},{"h":0.017547334541613391,"c":1,"w":0.78439422607421883,"x":0.08008214764441457,"y":0.64970930234938074,"t":"rackets used by the world's elite are not actually readily available to the public; rather, each"},{"h":0.017509603922345907,"c":1,"y":0.6671511628106378,"t":"racket is individually made to suit the player who uses it. Take the US professional tennis players","x":0.080082123916608058,"w":0.83367558797200525},{"c":1,"h":0.019357200780097727,"x":0.082090537196508162,"t":"Mike and Bob Bryan, for example:iWe're very particular with our racket specifications,' they","y":0.68449748435317948,"w":0.80297134399414061},{"w":0.79055440266927079,"h":0.01890906837485884,"x":0.080082132725939725,"c":1,"y":0.7020348839819549,"t":"say. 'All our rackets are sent from our manufacturer to Tampa, Florida, where our frames go"},{"t":"through a... thorough customisation process.' They explain how they have adjusted not","x":0.082135535409564683,"h":0.018903066134382418,"c":1,"y":0.71946902615546504,"w":0.75975357055664061},{"w":0.79055440266927079,"h":0.015990944246275229,"c":1,"t":"only racket length, but even experimented with different kinds of paint. The rackets they use","x":0.08213552955621907,"y":0.73982300912187526},{"x":0.084188924851924862,"t":"now weigh more than the average model and also have a denser string pattern (i.e. more crosses","y":0.75722713847491196,"h":0.014575186872904267,"w":0.81724843343098963,"c":1},{"t":"and mains).","h":0.016391073356335828,"c":1,"w":0.1072281265258789,"x":0.07994329396644384,"y":0.77403615715682139},{"y":0.80933351252045305,"w":0.79475916544596348,"h":0.017921949065892062,"t":"The primary reason for these modifications is simple: as the line between winning and losing","c":1,"x":0.082086456671771377},{"x":0.082135523939110153,"w":0.81314168294270828,"h":0.016054400441217531,"c":1,"t":"becomes thinner and thinner, even these slight changes become more and more important. As a","y":0.82848837220841287},{"w":0.82767501831054691,"t":"result, players and their teams are becoming increasingly creative with the modifications to their","h":0.020583896018059211,"c":1,"x":0.08000283681048577,"y":0.84298185895135314},{"h":0.016000377463731841,"w":0.53388092041015622,"t":"rackets as they look to maximise their competitive advantage.","y":0.86482558150930378,"x":0.08008212695049044,"c":1},{"y":0.92005813977636952,"t":"16","x":0.082135524359874493,"w":0.026694043477376292,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"x":0.51176469619230891,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.94166666659226195,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1,"w":0.45882354736328124}]}